---
description: Secret and credential paths are read/write denied to agents
globs: [.env, .env.*, **/.env, **/.env.*, **/*.pem, **/*.key, **/*credentials*.json, **/secrets/**]
write: deny
---
# Secrets Deny

Agents must never read, quote, edit, or commit these paths. Use the BYOK vault / OS keychain flows instead of opening secret files.
